{"id":"n58673-1-12","stage":2,"title":"보급 · 普及","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58673-1-12-1","ko":"한국의 인터넷 사용은 어떤가요?","zh":"韩国的互联网使用情况怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국의","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}},{"text":"인터넷","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}},{"text":"사용은","meaning":"使用，用，应用","explanation":"사용：使用，用，应用；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사용","audio":"/audio/93c558d72f27bb096611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66372","senseId":"1","lemma":"사용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사용은","audio":"/audio/d746bbdd1cd2c0360e40.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤가요","audio":"/audio/23fa3a0906f95e00f157.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"93c558d72f27bb09","term":"사용","zh":"使用，用，应用","audio":"/audio/93c558d72f27bb096611.mp3","entryId":"66372","definition":"按照情况或功能上的需要而利用。","pronunciation":["사ː용"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/242148a0b1b320dc5eb8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58673-1-12-2"